		\n				TICKETING INFO\nSeason tickets are now available. 6-show packages s
	tart at just $34 per-show. \nTickets are $46 and are available online or b
	y calling TUTS Guest Services at 713-558-8887. Tickets will also available
	 in person Monday through Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Offic
	e\, located in the Hobby Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are avai
	lable for parties of 10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of a
	ccessibility options for guests.Learn more about accessible performances a
	nd other services here. \nRush tickets will be available for $35 at the bo
	x office for mezzanine and gallery seating starting 2 hours prior to curta
